{
  "display": "form",
  "name": "processDataForm",
  "title": "Process data overview",
  "type": "form",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>What each table is, and where it comes from</h3><p>Every table below is one field. Its heading is the field's own declaration, so you can read off exactly what was asked for and from which source. A path ending in <code>*</code> renders every key the addressed object holds, so none of these keys are authored by hand.</p><p>A nested object shows as <code>{n}</code> and a list as <code>[n]</code>, n being the number of entries; address those with their own path to look inside.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Read from the zaak  —  ZAC_zaak_gegevens",
      "key": "from_zaak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "zaak_note",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<p>Source: the zaak as read live from Open Zaak over the ZGW API, plus its Flowable variables under <code>zaakdata</code>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_zaakdata_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_zaak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: zaakdata.*: </span><em>zaakdata.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_zaak_1",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_zaaktype_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_zaak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: zaaktype.*: </span><em>zaaktype.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_zaak_2",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDzaak_groep_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_zaak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: groep.*: </span><em>groep.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Read from the taak  —  ZAC_taak_gegevens",
      "key": "from_taak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "taak_note",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<p>Source: the Flowable task row and its task-local variables. Note that <code>taakdata</code> is not what this form submitted: ZAC merges every process variable into it on each open, which is why zaak fields appear here. <code>zaakUUID</code> and <code>zaaktypeUUID</code> are filtered out of that merge.</p>"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_taakdata_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_taak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: taakdata.*: </span><em>taakdata.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_taak_1",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_taakinformatie_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_taak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: taakinformatie.*: </span><em>taakinformatie.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        },
        {
          "type": "content",
          "key": "divider_taak_2",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<hr class=\"zac-gegevens-divider\">"
        },
        {
          "label": "",
          "type": "content",
          "key": "PDtaak_rechten_tabel",
          "input": false,
          "tableView": false,
          "html": "<span class=\"fw-medium\">ZAC_taak_gegevens  ·  ZAC_VELD: rechten.*: </span><em>rechten.* &mdash; no template equivalent: {{ }} cannot list keys it does not know</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Deliberate mistake",
      "key": "deliberate_mistakes",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
